  "body": "### What is the issue with the Compression Standard?\n\ne.g. https://compression.spec.whatwg.org/#compress-and-enqueue-a-chunk is written:\n\n>For each [Uint8Array](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-Uint8Array) array, [enqueue](https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/#transformstream-enqueue) array in cs's [transform](https://streams.spec.whatwg.org/#generictransformstream-transform).\n\nWould be nice to link to infra spec (and define a variable to actually iterate on)",
